 # Not in the original client (World of Legends): the post-processing shader of the native pass WolPost (wolAA, wolTonemap), brief E1.
 # Included by Shaders/VolFog/CMakeLists.txt right before the patch-Z.MPQ command, so that it uses the same chain (volfog_shader: fxc ->
 # Tools/VolFog/mkbls.py -> Tools/VolFog/mkmpq.py) and lands in the same MPQ. CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR is Shaders/VolFog here, hence the ../WolPost.
