+# Brief E4: twelve permutations, index = AA * 2 + TONEMAP + 6 * GRADE (GRADE 0 / 1: zone grading, wolGradeStrength); the first six are the ones of E1. Before E4 it had six, index = AA * 2 + TONEMAP (AA 0 off / 1 FXAA quality 12 / 2 FXAA high, TONEMAP 0 / 1); 0 is never drawn.
